Two proposed change docs (level major, Request only), with register rows:
- 2026-11-model-listings: provider model listings (OpenRouter public and
  per-account, then direct providers) become routes deterministically, with
  price, catalog capabilities and free-quota handling; research keeps the
  judgment part; cheapest-first routing preference.
- 2026-11-setup-ui: `baton ui`, an on-demand loopback page over the core for
  connecting CLI subscriptions and API accounts and managing the stable;
  needs an amendment of principles §0 rule 3, §1.1 #3 and §1.3.

Docs tests: tests/test_docs.py green.

